{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Third-Person Shooter and Platform Jumping and Level-based Adventure",
    "steam_appid": 3628020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/extras/e26a1d520e14b81eb997d9dcd067add5.avif?t=1755073670\" width=500 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons;During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game version roadmap:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person shooting mode: All equipment (7 pieces: jetpack, sword, rifle, rocket launcher, grenade, flamethrower, sofa);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level challenge Mode: All levels (40 levels);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town simulation mode: Town features (protagonist skin, equipment enhancement, item warehouse, coin dungeon, farm picking, daily tasks);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world mode: Character avatar customization system, Open world gameplay (added updated test scene).</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628020/extras/e26a1d520e14b81eb997d9dcd067add5.avif?t=1755073670\" width=500 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Introduction:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a level crossing game that combines third person shooter and platform jumping, and the game progresses linearly according to the order of the levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Description of game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The storyline of the game follows a linear progression through levels in order;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some levels require clever jumping sequences to pass;Some levels require the correct weapon selection to pass;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the process of passing levels, players can unlock more weapons;During the process of passing levels, players can encounter more map elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game version roadmap:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third person shooting mode: All equipment (7 pieces: jetpack, sword, rifle, rocket launcher, grenade, flamethrower, sofa);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level challenge Mode: All levels (40 levels);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Town simulation mode: Town features (protagonist skin, equipment enhancement, item warehouse, coin dungeon, farm picking, daily tasks);</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world mode: Character avatar customization system, Open world gameplay (added updated test scene).</p>",
